        {
          "id": "the_temperature_lookup_reaches_the_regClassID_zero_wildcard",
          "description": "adjust.rs:495-520 looks a temperatureadjustment row up by the exact regClassID and THEN by the regClassID 0 wildcard. `fixtures/mixed-onroad.esm` used to implement only the first step, and the only row in the table is the wildcard -- so its EV temperature terms came out 0, its raw adjustment 0 instead of -0.00419, and the `adj < 0` clamp returned the right factor of 1 FOR THE WRONG REASON (docs/esm-conventions.md §27.3).\n\nAT 59.5 degF THE CLAMP DOES NOT FIRE, and that is what this fixture adds. The raw EV adjustment is (59.5 - 72) x (0.00225 + 0.00028 x (59.5 - 72)) = -12.5 x -0.00125 = +0.015625, so the factor is 1.015625 and the wildcard row's two coefficients reach emissionQuant DIRECTLY, on all 82 electricity rows. At `mixed-onroad`'s 66.9 degF the same lookup produces -0.0041922 and is clamped away; delete the wildcard step there and every number is unchanged, delete it here and the fuel-9 rows move by 1.56%. This is §23's rule read the other way round: the fixture that can SEE a stage is the one whose scope puts the stage off its clamp.\n\nThe A/C clamp, by contrast, is FURTHER inside its boundary here than at hour 9: -0.2969815 against -0.0189. So this fixture checks the temperature arm the other onroad fixtures cannot and checks the A/C arm no better than they do, and §23 says to say so rather than to let the reader assume a colder hour exercises more of everything.\n\nWHAT IS STILL ASSERTED is the hour's 59.5 degF heat index, the A/C term's raw value and its clamp to 0, and the EV suppression flag at FALSE. The per-cohort lookup terms and the 1.015625 factor above had `coh_*` variables that the model no longer has, so the wildcard step itself is now checked only through the fuel-9 emissionQuant cells of `the_four_worked_examples_reach_MOVESOutput`.\n\nNeither the lookup nor either clamp is day-keyed -- `coh_*` is shaped [cohort_rows] -- so every assertion here is stated once and holds for both day blocks.",
          "time_span": {
            "start": 0.0,
            "end": 0.0
          },
          "tolerance": {
            "rel": 2e-06
          },
          "assertions": [
            {
              "variable": "Onroad.run_heatIndex",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 59.5,
              "coords": {
                "runspeccounty_rows": 1,
                "runspecmonth_rows": 1,
                "runspecday_rows": 1
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "Onroad.run_acActivityRaw",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": -0.2969815,
              "coords": {
                "runspeccounty_rows": 1,
                "runspecmonth_rows": 1,
                "runspecday_rows": 1
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "Onroad.run_acActivity",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 0.0,
              "coords": {
